            "icon": "star"
          }
        },
        "feature_XFPeiV": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/LionsMane_Mushroom_Mask2.png",
            "bg_color": "#bcd868",
            "bg_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#002531",
            "heading": "Plant-Powered Proprietary Focus Blend",
            "text": "<p>Here at HempLucid, we think life is <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/pages/about\" title=\"About\">BETTER WITHOUT CHEMICALS AND SYNTHETIC DRUGS</a> in our systems. That’s a major reason our <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/products/functional-gummies-focus-cbg-mushroom\" title=\"Focus Mushroom Gummies - Grape\">MUSHROOM FOCUS GUMMIES</a> rely on Lion’s Mane, CBD and CBG, and brain-boosting botanicals such as green coffee beans, L-Tyrosine, and L-Theanine, two amino acids that are supportive of brain function and relaxation. Taken in conjunction, this “power trio” has been shown to have <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC6880365/\" title=\"Effects of acute caffeine, theanine and tyrosine supplementation on mental and physical performance in athletes\">BRAIN-BOOSTING BENEFITS</a>.  </p><p><br/>In addition to being convenient (and just plain delicious), our Focus Gummies are formulated to be highly bioavailable. In essence, this means that an especially high percentage of their functional compounds make it into the bloodstream to have the most impact and effect. That’s one reason many people experience positive effects with just half a gummy a day. That said, because of the robust safety profiles of all ingredients, it’s perfectly safe to take up to two Focus Gummies a day for maximum support.</p>",
            "read_more": false,
            "read_more_external": false,
            "read_more_url": "",
            "show_segments": false,
            "segments": 4,
