    "wl_image_text_cta_za6tW4": {
      "type": "wl-image-text-cta",
      "blocks": {
        "image_ipYjV6": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cbg-and-cbd.png",
            "bkg_color": "#595378",
            "font_color": "#ffffff",
            "tagline": "",
            "title": "Water Soluble CBD and CBN",
            "content": "<p>CBD and CBN are hemp-derived cannabinoids that interact with the body's endocannabinoid system, which helps regulate functions like sleep, stress, memory, and immune response. Research suggests CBD may support stress relief, better sleep, and minor pain management, while CBN is primarily known for promoting sleep and reducing discomfort.</p><p>Because cannabinoids are oil-based, water-soluble CBD is created by breaking CBD oil into tiny droplets that are easier for the body to absorb. This formulation uses organic sunflower lecithin and a nano electrolyte blend to enhance absorption without synthetic additives or contaminants.</p>",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_link": ""
          }
        },
        "image_Cam9hg": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/hemplucid-life.png",
            "bkg_color": "#ffd700",
            "font_color": "#010101",
            "tagline": "",
            "title": "Why Choose HempLucid?",
            "content": "<p>HempLucid’s <strong>water-soluble CBD</strong> stands out for its proprietary nano electrolyte blend, which embeds nanoclusters of water into the formulation to enhance absorption, along with our use of certified organic sunflower lecithin instead of the synthetic emulsifiers commonly used in many water-soluble CBD products. We also emphasize USDA Organic standards, full-spectrum hemp extracts, transparent third-party testing, and a versatile formula that can be taken sublingually or mixed into beverages.</p>",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_link": ""
          }
        },
        "image_GP3xtF": {
          "type": "image",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/plant-powered-focus-blend.png",
            "bkg_color": "#bcd868",
            "font_color": "#010101",
            "tagline": "",
            "title": "Plant-Powered^ Proprietary Focus Blend",
            "content": "<p>Here at HempLucid, we think life is <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/pages/about\" target=\"_blank\">BETTER WITHOUT CHEMICALS AND SYNTHETIC DRUGS</a> in our systems. That’s a major reason our <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/products/functional-gummies-focus-cbg-mushroom\" target=\"_blank\">MUSHROOM FOCUS GUMMIES</a> rely on Lion’s Mane, CBD and CBG, and brain-boosting botanicals such as green coffee beans, L-Tyrosine, and L-Theanine, two amino acids that are supportive of brain function and relaxation. Taken in conjunction, this “power trio” has been shown to have <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC6880365/\" target=\"_blank\">BRAIN-BOOSTING BENEFITS</a>. </p><p><br/>In addition to being convenient (and just plain delicious), our Focus Gummies are formulated to be highly bioavailable. In essence, this means that an especially high percentage of their functional compounds make it into the bloodstream to have the most impact and effect. That’s one reason many people experience positive effects with just half a gummy a day. That said, because of the robust safety profiles of all ingredients, it’s perfectly safe to take up to two Focus Gummies a day for maximum support.<br/><br/></p>",
            "cta_text": "Read More",
            "cta_link": "#"
          }
        }
      },
