          }
        },
        "question_g4RbU6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How Much Water Soluble CBD Should I Take?",
            "answer": "<p>Start with the serving size on the packaging and adjust gradually — the right amount depends on factors like metabolism and body composition. CBD builds a presence in the body over time rather than producing a dramatic immediate effect, so we recommend consistent daily use for thirty days to judge how a tincture works for you. Take it under the tongue about five to ten minutes before you want to feel the effects, or dissolve it into food or drink for steadier absorption. Our <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/blogs/blog/how-much-cbd-oil-should-i-take\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">CBD dosage guide</span></a> can help you find a starting point.<br/><br/></p>",
            "button_txt": "",
