            "info": ""
          }
        },
        "question_n3jn6r": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does Water Soluble CBD Show Up on Drug Tests?",
            "answer": "<p>It can. Full spectrum products contain trace THC that is detectable on certain drug tests, so if you're facing a test soon, it's prudent to pause use or choose a THC-free isolate — and check the rules of your testing authority first.</p>",
