          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How Should I Store Water Soluble CBD?",
            "answer": "<p>Keep it in a cool place away from direct sunlight and heat. A refrigerator is a good choice for liquids; powders and crystals do fine in a cabinet. As always, store it out of reach of children.</p>",
